          "text": "**Inline Command:** `<% … %>`",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 37,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is used for simple expressions or commands that return a value to be inserted. The plugin executes the code inside and replaces the entire tag with the resulting string.",
          "indent_level": 3,
          "line_number": 39,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**JavaScript Code Block:** `<%* … %>`",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 40,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is used for more complex, multi-line JavaScript. This block allows you to define variables, use logic (like `if` statements), and call functions *without* automatically inserting a value. You must use `tR` (Template Result) to output values.",
          "indent_level": 3,
          "line_number": 41,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
