        },
        {
          "text": "**`await`:** You *must* use `await` for functions that are asynchronous, like `tp.system.prompt()`.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 156,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**`tR`:** This special variable holds the \"template result\". In a `<%* … %>` block, nothing is output *unless* you add it to `tR`. Use `tR += \"your string\"` to append to the output.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 161,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Moment.js Documentation:** Since `tp.date` is a wrapper for Moment.js, its official documentation is the ultimate resource for all possible date/time formatting strings.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 182,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**JavaScript Basics (ES6+):** Understanding variables (`const`, `let`), strings (especially template literals: `` `string ${variable}` ``), and `async`/`await` will dramatically increase what you can do.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 194,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Obsidian Dataview:** Templater can be used to *create* metadata (like `key: value`) that the Dataview plugin can then *query*, allowing you to build dynamic \"Maps of Content\" (MOCs) and dashboards.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 201,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Obsidian QuickAdd:** This plugin works wonderfully with Templater. You can create a QuickAdd command that runs a Templater template, allowing you to bind complex template scripts to a single hotkey.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 210,
          "source": "reference-guide-templater-plugin-20251025160911.md"
        }
      ]
